        <div class="drivers">The war erodes popular legitimacy while the Araghchi-IRGC factional tension (Pezeshkian's Araghchi-ouster attempt, May 1) shows internal incoherence at the diplomatic apex; the enrichment deadlock simultaneously forecloses the economic relief that would stabilize the regime's domestic position. Khamenei's 79-day silence on the negotiation file is a structural fragility indicator, not merely a communication choice. Regime stability factors — IRGC control of domestic security, oil income to IRGC-adjacent entities despite sanctions — prevent a higher estimate.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="regime-row">
        <span class="name">🇮🇱 Israel (Netanyahu Steps Down)</span>
