        <div class="drivers">F7 RESOLVED-YES (coalition at 60 seats since July 2025), N1 at 88% and N3 at 82% project dissolution passage within days, and N5 (election date set by June 15) at 70% — all point toward an election before October 27. Channel 12 polling (Beyachad-26 vs Likud-25) and Degel HaTorah's public trust withdrawal are concrete political indicators of a post-Netanyahu electoral environment. Range reflects uncertainty on exact dissolution timing and whether Netanyahu pursues a legal-delay strategy.</div>
      </div>
